    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0016-07",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 16,
      "text": "The team decides they have enough “testing” and should head back to tell the others what they discovered."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0022-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 22,
      "line_end": 22,
      "text": "As the group approaches the preparations happening in the field, they find Stafl singing and directing the workers from a makeshift throne of barrels on the back of a wagon."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0024-09",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 24,
      "text": "The rest of the Questionable Company decide to take a short rest as their final preparation."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0026-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 26,
      "line_end": 26,
      "text": "Questionable Company, along with the townsfolk, watch as the forest comes within range of their plan."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0026-03",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 26,
      "line_end": 26,
      "text": "Immediately they can all see the trees pull back and then start to turn to the east, away from the town."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0030-02",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "text": "The group sets off from the town, Ephanna keeping a close eye on Thrin."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0030-03",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "text": "Thirty minutes later they come across an unusual sight: a wagon partly unloaded and horses wandering around a stack of crates."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0034-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 34,
      "text": "Caelynn continues to wait on the line for an answer from Tealeaf as the rest of the group set up a proper camp for a rest."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0034-02",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 34,
      "text": "They need to set up a shelter for the animals and themselves as it is clear the storm is approaching and Karesmine can see it is bringing the magical shimmering rain."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0034-03",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 34,
      "text": "Ephanna plans to create a disguise and go back to town for new supplies, but for the moment the group is settling in for a rest around the camp."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0024-05",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 24,
      "text": "They reveal that she is in charge of the workers in town and she means business."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0026-05",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 26,
      "line_end": 26,
      "text": "The mayor and sheriff congratulate the heroes and thank them again for all their help."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0024-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 24,
      "text": "She stands up to her full Bugbear height and begins to scream at him."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0024-02",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 24,
      "text": "She finds just the right words to cut deep: he smells like a circus animal."
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u-L0020-01",
      "path": "corpus/eldyrwild-markdown/Longmont Campaign/Campaign 2/Session Recaps/Session 20 - Recap.md",
      "line_start": 20,
      "line_end": 20,
      "text": "Stuart is so happy with the outcome that he runs out the door, racing off to tell his mom the good news."
    }
  ],
